#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:10
msgid "Lazy vs. Rich Training Regimes"
msgstr "lazy regime 与 rich regime"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:13
msgid ""
"Output scaling controls whether a wide ReLU network learns moving "
"features or stays close to its initialization."
msgstr "输出缩放决定宽 ReLU 网络是学习不断变化的特征，还是始终接近初始化状态。"

