#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:39
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "摘要"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:42
msgid ""
"This runnable graph contrasts feature learning with lazy, kernel-like "
"training on a two-dimensional teacher-student problem. It is a "
"qualitative exploration of the scaling mechanism described by Chizat, "
"Oyallon, and Bach."
msgstr "这个可运行图在二维 teacher-student 问题上，对比特征学习与 lazy regime（近似 kernel 方法的训练）。"
"它定性探索了 Chizat、Oyallon 与 Bach 所描述的缩放机制。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:47
msgid ""
"**Paper:** [On Lazy Training in Differentiable "
"Programming](https://arxiv.org/abs/1812.07956), Chizat, Oyallon, and Bach"
" (NeurIPS 2019)"
msgstr ""
"**论文：** [On Lazy Training in Differentiable Programming](https://arxiv.org/abs/1812.07956)，"
"Chizat、Oyallon 与 Bach（NeurIPS 2019）"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:49
msgid "**Template:** `lazy vs rich regime`"
msgstr "**模板：** `lazy vs rich regime`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:51
msgid "**Template ID:** `d2e8cdd7-d14c-42c3-94dc-ba2b419c07f9`"
