#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:53
msgid "Reproduction Goal"
msgstr "复现目标"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:55
msgid ""
"The output multiplier $\\alpha$ controls the size of the network output "
"at initialization. Small $\\alpha$ permits substantial feature motion "
"(the rich regime); large $\\alpha$ keeps weights close to their starting "
"point (the lazy or tangent-kernel regime). The graph makes that "
"distinction visible through loss, weight displacement, and hidden-neuron "
"trajectories."
msgstr ""
"输出乘子 $\\alpha$ 控制网络初始化时的输出尺度。较小的 $\\alpha$ 允许特征显著移动（rich regime）；"
"较大的 $\\alpha$ 则使权重保持在初始位置附近（lazy regime 或 tangent-kernel regime）。"
"该图通过损失、权重位移和隐藏神经元轨迹，将两者的差异直观呈现出来。"

