msgstr "权重范数、训练/测试差距、相对位移与二维神经元轨迹"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:72
msgid "Run in Comfy Research"
msgstr "在 Comfy Research 中运行"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:74
msgid "Open **Templates** and load `lazy vs rich regime`."
msgstr "打开 **Templates**，加载 `lazy vs rich regime`。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:75
msgid ""
"Run at a small `outputScale`, such as 0.01, and inspect displacement and "
"neuron trajectories."
msgstr "以较小的 `outputScale`（例如 0.01）运行，并查看位移与神经元轨迹。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:77
msgid ""
"Repeat with larger values and compare final loss and relative weight "
