msgstr "改用更大的取值重复运行，并比较最终损失与相对权重位移。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:79
msgid ""
"Loaded Lazy vs. Rich template in the Comfy Research canvas, showing "
"teacher data, the scaled student MLP, Trainer, and observables."
msgstr "Comfy Research 画布中已加载 lazy vs rich regime 模板，显示 teacher 数据、经过缩放的 student MLP、Trainer 与 observables。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:84
msgid "Results and Interpretation"
msgstr "结果与解释"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:86
msgid ""
"Small $\\alpha$ should produce visible hidden-feature motion; at larger "
"$\\alpha$, relative displacement should be small and learning should "
"resemble a fixed-feature model. The transition is not a universal "
"threshold: it depends on width, initialization, optimizer, and time "
"scaling."
msgstr ""
"较小的 $\\alpha$ 应带来可见的隐藏特征移动；当 $\\alpha$ 较大时，相对位移应较小，"
"学习过程更接近固定特征模型。这种转变没有普适阈值，取决于宽度、初始化、优化器和时间缩放。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:91
msgid ""
"Neuron trajectory visualization after a Lazy vs. Rich run with a small "
"output scale, showing compact hidden-feature motion."
msgstr "以较小输出尺度运行 lazy vs rich regime 后的神经元轨迹图，显示紧凑的隐藏特征移动。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:96
msgid ""
"Neuron trajectory visualization after a Lazy vs. Rich run with a large "
"output scale, showing a wider feature trajectory."
msgstr "以较大输出尺度运行 lazy vs rich regime 后的神经元轨迹图，显示更宽的特征轨迹。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:101
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "局限性"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:103
msgid "This is a synthetic two-dimensional teaching setting."
msgstr "这是一个合成的二维教学场景。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:104
msgid "A sweep does not establish asymptotic scaling laws."
msgstr "一次 sweep 不能确立渐近缩放定律。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/lazy-vs-rich-regime.md:105
msgid "Fair comparisons across $\\alpha$ can require time and loss rescaling."
msgstr "要公平比较不同的 $\\alpha$，可能需要重新缩放时间与损失。"
